1
00:00:00,157 --> 00:00:01,987
(Sheldon:)Who's Nowitzki?

2
00:00:03,452 --> 00:00:06,832
- I'm Nowitzki.
- Oh, you want me to share credit?

3
00:00:06,997 --> 00:00:08,377
(Leonard:)Uh-huh.

4
00:00:08,666 --> 00:00:10,876
(Sheldon:)Get out.

5
00:00:12,211 --> 00:00:15,211
- Oh, hey. Hi.
RAMONA: Oh, bite me.

6
00:00:17,258 --> 00:00:19,178
(Ramona:)Sisters?

7
00:00:22,721 --> 00:00:25,811
(Girl(arriving):)Excuse me, Dr. Cooper.
I'm Kathy O'Brian.

8
00:00:25,975 --> 00:00:27,475
(Girl:)I just finished reading your paper...

9
00:00:27,643 --> 00:00:29,853
(Girl:)...reconciling
the black hole information paradox...

10
00:00:30,020 --> 00:00:34,020
(Girl:)...with your theory of string-network
condensates, and it took my breath away.

11
00:00:35,568 --> 00:00:38,908
(Sheldon:)Maybe when I publish it,
I'll include an inhaler.

12
00:00:41,907 --> 00:00:44,827
(Kathy:)Would you possibly have any time
for me to pick your brain?

13
00:00:45,619 --> 00:00:46,869
(Sheldon:)Let's see. Today's Thursday.

14
00:00:47,037 --> 00:00:48,957
(Sheldon:)Thursday nights
I eat pizza from Giacomo's.

15
00:00:49,123 --> 00:00:52,963
(Sheldon:)- Sausage, mushrooms, light olives.
- Great. I'll bring it to your place.

16
00:00:53,127 --> 00:00:58,027
(Kathy:)I have the address.

